{"4799510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rabbits From The Gas Planet", "steam_appid": 4799510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4799650], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rabbits From The Gas Planet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rabbits have arrived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, they're from the Gas Planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with little more than your weapons, your wits, and an unhealthy tolerance for toxic fumes, you must defend your home against an increasingly ridiculous alien invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a few harmless rabbits quickly turns into complete chaos as larger and deadlier breeds emerge. Some release clouds of toxic gas. Others launch explosive poop bombs. And somewhere out there, an enormous rabbit monstrosity is preparing to finish the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through waves of invading rabbits, survive escalating battles, earn money for upgrades, and prepare for absurd boss encounters in this comedy FPS inspired by classic arena shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4799510/extras/356eec5c16cc9597166779a61d7a3b28.poster.avif?t=1785365403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4799510/extras/356eec5c16cc9597166779a61d7a3b28.webm?t=1785365403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4799510/extras/356eec5c16cc9597166779a61d7a3b28.mp4?t=1785365403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced first-person shooter combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple rabbit enemy types with unique attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toxic gas hazards and explosive poop bombs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your arsenal between battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large-scale boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-based survival gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ridiculous sci-fi comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your home from an alien rabbit invasion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4799510/extras/b556460a2a7a47303282814fa517ec01.poster.avif?t=1785365403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4799510/extras/b556460a2a7a47303282814fa517ec01.webm?t=1785365403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4799510/extras/b556460a2a7a47303282814fa517ec01.mp4?t=1785365403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Survive The Gas Planet?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rabbits may look cute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That won't stop them from farting on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4799510/extras/b21fe6270d4fbc27cbcb03b2ef233d0d.poster.avif?t=1785365403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4799510/extras/b21fe6270d4fbc27cbcb03b2ef233d0d.webm?t=1785365403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4799510/extras/b21fe6270d4fbc27cbcb03b2ef233d0d.mp4?t=1785365403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rabbits From The Gas Planet</h2><p class=